<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Immorality Club</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Metal+Mania&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0b0b0b;
      --ink: #e8e8e8;
      --body: #cfcfcf;
      --dim: #999;
      --rule: #2a2a2a;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--body);
      font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    header {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 3.5rem 1rem 2.5rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    }

    .region {
      display: block;
      font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.3em;
      color: var(--dim);
      margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    }

    .name {
      display: block;
      font-family: "Metal Mania", cursive;
      font-size: 3rem;
      line-height: 1.1;
      color: var(--ink);
      letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    }

    main {
      max-width: 34rem;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 2.5rem 1.25rem 3rem;
    }

    main h2 {
      font-family: "Metal Mania", cursive;
      font-weight: normal;
      font-size: 1.6rem;
      color: var(--ink);
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
      margin: 2.5rem 0 0.75rem;
    }

    main h2:first-child {
      margin-top: 0;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--dim);
      border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
      padding: 1.5rem 1rem;
    }

    footer a {
      color: var(--dim);
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <span class="region">UTAH VALLEY</span>
    <span class="name">IMMORALITY CLUB</span>
  </header>
  <main>
    <h2>A Confession</h2>
    <p>The Immorality Club is a small tradition kept within the
    Morality Club itself &mdash; not a rival society, but a private
    joke the membership plays on itself. Its business is the harmless
    prank, carried out by members upon one another, always in good
    humor and never in malice.</p>

    <h2>Its Purpose</h2>
    <p>The prank is not mischief for its own sake. It stands as a
    standing reminder that no one among us, however carefully
    practiced in character, is entirely without flaw &mdash; and that
    a club built on the cultivation of good character had better be
    able to laugh at itself first.</p>
  </main>
  <footer>
    <p>What is chartered in daylight is, on occasion, chartered in
    jest. &mdash; <a href="/">Return to the Club</a></p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
